msgstr ""

#: includes/class-in-synced.php:691
msgid "Replace mode clears selected receiver tables only after a complete verified SQL backup is written outside the public web root. Backups default to in-synced-private-backups beside WordPress; configure IN_SYNCED_BACKUP_DIR if needed. The newest five completed backups are retained. Pause receiver edits/background jobs during replacement. Stop push keeps completed changes; restore backups manually when needed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-in-synced.php:692
msgid "Every media/file push also needs writable private staging, even with database replace disabled. Private storage must share the target filesystem so verified files can be replaced atomically. Configure a private IN_SYNCED_BACKUP_DIR on that filesystem if the default path is unavailable."
msgstr ""

